{"seq":3,"slug":"pruning-and-distillation","title":"第三章 剪枝与知识蒸馏","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-compression-inference/pruning-and-distillation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pruning-basics","title":"剪枝的基本思想","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-compression-inference/pruning-and-distillation/pruning-basics","wordCount":1782,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"structured-vs-unstructured","title":"结构化与非结构化剪枝","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-compression-inference/pruning-and-distillation/structured-vs-unstructured","wordCount":1824,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"knowledge-distillation","title":"知识蒸馏：大模型教小模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-compression-inference/pruning-and-distillation/knowledge-distillation","wordCount":1878,"readingTime":8},{"seq":4,"slug":"distillation-applications","title":"知识蒸馏的应用与意义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/model-compression-inference/pruning-and-distillation/distillation-applications","wordCount":1824,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"第三章-剪枝与知识蒸馏\">第三章 剪枝与知识蒸馏</h1><p>继量化之后，本章介绍另外两条压缩路径——剪枝与知识蒸馏。它们从不同的维度发掘模型的潜力：剪枝着眼于&quot;参数数量&quot;，基于模型存在大量冗余的洞察，识别并移除那些无关紧要的参数与结构；知识蒸馏则另辟蹊径，不改造大模型，而是用大模型作&quot;老师&quot;,去训练一个小巧的&quot;学生&quot;模型。</p>\n<p>本章分四节：先讲剪枝的基本思想，再讲结构化与非结构化剪枝的分野；然后转入知识蒸馏的核心思想与&quot;软标签&quot;机制，最后讲蒸馏的应用与意义。读完本章，你将掌握&quot;在原模型上做减法&quot;（剪枝）与&quot;以大教小&quot;（蒸馏）这两种互补的压缩思路。</p>\n"}